<figcaption class="ltx_caption" style="font-size:80%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span>The proposed MoE-based PPO algorithm for optimal contract design</figcaption>
