              <span id="alg1.6.8.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Obtain the current reward </span><math id="alg1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r(\mathbf{s}_{t},\mathbf{a}_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.800em">r</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.800em">𝐬</mi><mi mathsize="0.800em">t</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.800em">,</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.800em">𝐚</mi><mi mathsize="0.800em">t</mi></msub><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r(\mathbf{s}_{t},\mathbf{a}_{t})</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.6.8.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">.
</span>
