<div id="alg1.6.10" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="alg1.6.10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">  </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="alg1.6.10.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">    </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="alg1.6.10.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">  </span>
