</div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S5.F6.sf3.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">(c)</span> </span><span id="S5.F6.sf3.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">The impact of auxiliary loss weights, with <math id="S5.F6.sf3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M=3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M=3</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S5.F6.sf3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m=1</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="S5.F6.sf3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{a}=10^{-4}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{a}=10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
